    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 28.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ðonne oðierne ⁊ orige weorðe, þonne bið he wites scyldig.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he escapes and cannot be found, then [the captor] is liable for a fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, the thief escapes and is lost to sight, then he shall forfeit a fine.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">gif he ðonne oþyrne ⁊ orige weorðe, þonne bið he wites scyldig.</ab>
      </div>
